  "title": "Easy Crustless Quiche",
  "description": "This crustless quiche made with eggs, cream, and crispy bacon is a fuss-free, low-carb meal that's easy to customize with your favorite cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Jim"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:03:31-04:00",
